message.content:
下面给出一个示例，展示如何在多轮对话中使用 `get_current_weather` 函数。  
每条对话都用 **JSON** 表示，方便后续直接导入或做进一步处理。

```json
[
  [   /* 对话 1：用户询问旧金山天气并跟进是否会下雨 */
    {"role":"user","content":"What's the weather in San Francisco?"},
    {"role":"assistant","function_call":{
        "name":"get_current_weather",
        "arguments":{"location":"San Francisco, CA"}
      }},
    {"role":"function","name":"get_current_weather","arguments":{"location":"San Francisco, CA"},
     "response":{"temperature":68,"description":"cloudy"}},
    {"role":"assistant","content":"It is currently 68°F and cloudy in San Francisco."},

    {"role":"user","content":"Will it rain today?"},
    {"role":"assistant","function_call":{
        "name":"get_current_weather",
        "arguments":{"location":"San Francisco, CA","unit":"celsius"}
      }},
    {"role":"function","name":"get_current_weather","arguments":{"location":"San Francisco, CA","unit":"celsius"},
     "response":{"temperature":20,"description":"light showers"}},
    {"role":"assistant","content":"There will be light showers today, with a temperature of about 20°C."}
  ],

  [   /* 对话 2：用户询问东京天气（使用摄氏度） */
    {"role":"user","content":"How about the weather in Tokyo?"},
    {"role":"assistant","function_call":{
        "name":"get_current_weather",
        "arguments":{"location":"Tokyo, Japan","unit":"celsius"}
      }},
    {"role":"function","name":"get_current_weather","arguments":{"location":"Tokyo, Japan","unit":"celsius"},
     "response":{"temperature":22,"description":"partly cloudy"}},
    {"role":"assistant","content":"It is currently 22°C and partly cloudy in Tokyo."}
  ],

  [   /* 对话 3：用户询问伦敦明天天气，并随后想知道温度范围 */
    {"role":"user","content":"What will the weather be like tomorrow in London?"},
    {"role":"assistant","function_call":{
        "name":"get_current_weather",
        "arguments":{"location":"London, UK"}
      }},
    {"role":"function","name":"get_current_weather","arguments":{"location":"London, UK"},
     "response":{"temperature":60,"description":"rainy"}},
    {"role":"assistant","content":"Tomorrow in London it will be 60°F and rainy."},

    {"role":"user","content":"What is the temperature range expected?"},
    {"role":"assistant","function_call":{
        "name":"get_current_weather",
        "arguments":{"location":"London, UK","unit":"celsius"}
      }},
    {"role":"function","name":"get_current_weather","arguments":{"location":"London, UK","unit":"celsius"},
     "response":{"temperature":15,"description":"rainy"}},
    {"role":"assistant","content":"The temperature will be around 15°C, so expect it to stay cool."}
  ]
]
```

### 说明

| 字段 | 含义 |
|------|------|
| `role` | 消息角色，可取值 `"user"`、`"assistant"`、`"function"` |
| `content` | 用户或助手的文本内容；若为函数调用则为 `null` 或省略 |
| `function_call` | 当 `role` 为 `"assistant"` 且要调用函数时出现，包含 `name` 与 `arguments` |
| `name` | 调用的函数名 |
| `arguments` | 传递给函数的参数对象 |
| `response` | 函数返回的数据（仅在 `role` 为 `"function"` 时出现） |

> **注意**：上述 JSON 只是演示结构，实际使用时需要根据你们的系统接口格式进行微调，例如 OpenAI 的 `function_call` 在 `arguments` 中通常是字符串形式的 JSON。
